    "text": "no. of moles of $\\mathrm{CH}_4\\left(\\mathrm{n}_1\\right)=\\frac{4}{16}=0.25 \\mathrm{~mol}$\nno. of moles of $\\mathrm{CO}_2\\left(\\mathrm{n}_2\\right)=\\frac{4.4}{44}=0.1 \\mathrm{~mol}$\nTotal no. of moles $\\left(\\mathrm{n}_{\\mathrm{T}}\\right)=\\mathrm{n}_1+\\mathrm{n}_2=0.35 \\mathrm{~mol}$\n$\\therefore \\quad P=\\frac{0.35 \\times 0.082 \\times 300}{1}=8.6 \\mathrm{~atm}$",
